1
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,439
Wait.

2
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:41,000
Are you two also going to turn against me?

3
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,840
It's just a video.

4
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,799
A delay won't hurt.

5
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,439
Why all the fuss?

6
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,799
It's not about the video.

7
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,599
Then what is it?

8
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,719
Making a scene this early?

9
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,319
Zhou Yang,

10
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,599
Gu Chenyang might be transferring.

11
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,439
What?

12
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,840
He didn't even tell me.

13
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,479
I'm his childhood friend.

14
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:26,719
Now you know

15
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:28,120
why I'm mad.

16
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,080
And it's that Yudong.

17
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,199
Is it possible

18
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,199
he's not transferring,

19
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,599
just checking it out?

20
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:41,000
He's already got the jersey.

21
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,360
It's got the name

22
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,000
and number on it.

23
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,000
I took a picture.

24
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,479
You can see it clearly.

25
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,000
Don't get me wrong.

26
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,719
We really have finished eating.

27
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,560
Those who finally

28
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,840
reach the top of the pyramid

29
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,759
are often lonely.

30
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,960
Sometimes, you can only choose

31
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,080
between grades and friendship.

32
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,360
Here comes my idol.

33
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,759
Why do you suddenly invite me to play basketball?

34
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,360
Do I need a reason?

35
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,199
Let's have a match.

36
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,879
If I lose,

37
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,959
I'll treat you to water.

38
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:19,839
Water from my idol.

39
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,199
Thanks.

40
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,040
Nice.

41
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,800
You're not in good form today.

42
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,879
You lost to me.

43
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,480
Is it because of the transfer

44
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,800
to Yudong?

45
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:37,720
I heard they're also looking for you.

46
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,120
Many schools are.

47
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,480
I'm quite popular.

48
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:45,800
Have you decided where to go?

49
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,560
Not yet.

50
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,800
If it's about the best training,

51
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,000
the Institute of Physical Education

52
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,240
and Yudong are the top choices.

53
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,680
But I feel like something's missing.

54
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,680
What's missing?

55
00:05:58,759 --> 00:06:00,399
I'm not sure how to explain it.

56
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,480
For example, your team,

57
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,160
although not a top-tier team,

58
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:09,040
has a great atmosphere.

59
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:10,639
You are very united.

60
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:12,759
You go together

61
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,240
to secretly spy on the enemy,

62
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:16,600
and go to the island to watch the meteor shower.

63
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,279
Good shot.

64
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,839
None of these are serious matters,

65
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,759
but they are very warm.

66
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:25,879
I think

67
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,519
this is team spirit.

68
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,199
Team spirit?

69
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:32,920
Yeah.

70
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,439
That's what's missing

71
00:06:34,439 --> 00:06:35,319
at our school.

72
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:37,480
What do you think

73
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,600
if I transfer to Yibei?

74
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,399
Your school is so good.

75
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,399
Are you willing to leave?

76
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:44,759
That's true.

77
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,279
That's why I'm upset.

78
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,279
And you?

79
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,639
Are you going to transfer to a better team?

80
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:55,839
I...

81
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,319
I haven't decided yet.

82
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:01,959
You sound pretty sure

83
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,920
when you talk about me.

84
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,079
Maybe

85
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,439
that's because I'm an outsider.

86
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,399
Just like my dad.

87
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,120
Nice.

88
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:39,959
Gu Tingjun

89
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:41,639
won first prize

90
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,839
in this competition.

91
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,240
It's incredible.

92
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:46,959
Mom.

93
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,720
Come here.

94
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,040
Your dad is working overtime.

95
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,839
He won't be back until late.

96
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,839
You can take a break.

97
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,480
Mom,

98
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,680
what are you looking at?

99
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,680
These are all your dad's treasures.

100
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:04,759
Treasures?

101
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,920
When we got married,

102
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:10,000
he moved from his hometown to Yibei.

103
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,240
After all that sorting,

104
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,639
he only brought back this box of stuff.

105
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,800
It was his "dowry".

106
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,120
Impressive.

107
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,480
He was the first one

108
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,279
from his hometown

109
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,720
to get into a prestigious university.

110
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:29,879
When I knew him,

111
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,360
the whole school

112
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,480
called him a learning genius.

113
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,840
Later I found out

114
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:38,360
that his IQ wasn't actually higher than mine.

115
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,200
He just worked

116
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:44,159
many times harder than others,

117
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:46,159
to push himself to the limit,

118
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,360
which allowed him

119
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,960
to stay ahead.

120
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:53,720
Maybe he hoped I'd do the same.

121
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:57,519
That's how he succeeded.

122
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,600
He had no resources where he was born,

123
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,600
and no good fallback options.

124
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:05,240
So he had to rely on himself.

125
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:08,039
The life he has today,

126
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,080
for him,

127
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,799
is truly hard-won.

128
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,960
He's so strict with you

129
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:16,639
because he cares about you.

130
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,919
He hopes your future

131
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,000
will be smoother.

132
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,879
What's this?

133
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,799
This is

134
00:09:31,799 --> 00:09:34,279
your dad's good buddy.

135
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,960
Good buddy?

136
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,440
Look, it's written on the back.

137
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,919
This was the reward

138
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:42,320
when he got

139
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,759
the top score in the city,

140
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:45,720
the school gave him this as a reward.

141
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,720
In his long years

142
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,120
of fighting alone,

143
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,919
he didn't have time to make friends.

144
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,519
This was his only companion,

145
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,200
and it was like his comrade-in-arms.

146
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,080
It's all broken.

147
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,799
Even so,

148
00:10:02,799 --> 00:10:04,039
he still cherishes it.

149
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,799
So many certificates.

150
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:11,440
What competition is this?

151
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,480
This doll.

152
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,799
The one you sold at the charity auction.

153
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,080
Yes.

154
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,440
But back then,

155
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,039
wasn't it bought

156
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:23,679
by a young lady?

157
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:28,080
That lady was your dad's plant.

158
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:30,879
He knew

159
00:10:30,879 --> 00:10:33,519
your charity auction venue was unreliable.

160
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,120
but you didn't care.

161
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:37,720
He wanted

162
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:40,519
to let you experience failure,

163
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:44,480
but in the end, he couldn't bear it,

164
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,759
so he had someone

165
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:48,200
buy the doll.

166
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:55,039
I'm going to take a shower.

167
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,519
If you're interested,

168
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,559
feel free to read more.

169
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,320
Okay.

170
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,000
[I've created a new group chat,]

171
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,519
without Gu Chenyang.

172
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,039
From now on,

173
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,600
you can send messages

174
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,600
in this new group.

175
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,440
Isn't this a bit over the top?

176
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,879
What if he's just looking into it,

177
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,000
not really planning to transfer?

178
00:12:31,799 --> 00:12:32,840
I think Gu Chenyang

179
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,240
is probably being forced.

180
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,600
Since his dad

181
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,600
showed up at school,

182
00:12:38,639 --> 00:12:39,799
I sensed something was off.

183
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,039
If he's forced,

184
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,879
why hide it from us?

185
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:55,559
Maybe he doesn't want us to worry.

186
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,960
Once it's resolved,

187
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,360
he'll tell us.

188
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,600
Gu Chenyang's calling.

189
00:13:04,879 --> 00:13:05,679
Pick up.

190
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:06,600
Put it on speaker.

191
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,600
Need something from me?

192
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:16,679
Fu Binyan,

193
00:13:18,759 --> 00:13:20,240
If I'm leaving Yibei,

194
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,399
can you take over the basketball team?

195
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:44,679
Are you really transferring to Yudong?

196
00:15:58,919 --> 00:15:59,720
You

197
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,519
all know?

198
00:16:03,279 --> 00:16:04,360
Actually, that day,

199
00:16:05,559 --> 00:16:07,240
Qingyuan and I saw it.

200
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,480
You're going to Yudong

201
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:12,360
and even took their jersey.

202
00:16:19,519 --> 00:16:21,320
We heard you calling Fu Binyan

203
00:16:21,519 --> 00:16:22,879
last night.

204
00:16:25,919 --> 00:16:26,720
Gu Chenyang,

205
00:16:27,799 --> 00:16:29,200
do you even consider us friends?

206
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,919
Such a big deal,

207
00:16:32,679 --> 00:16:34,039
and you didn't say a word?

208
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,240
I...

209
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,000
Gu Chenyang!

210
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,279
I'm sorry.

211
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,799
Sorry?

212
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,880
That's all you've got to say

213
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:08,480
after all this?

214
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,559
Lin Qingyuan!

215
00:17:10,559 --> 00:17:11,480
Lin Qingyuan!

216
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:13,240
You're the captain,

217
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:15,799
and you made a deal with the principal

218
00:17:15,799 --> 00:17:17,119
to make it to the top eight!

219
00:17:18,039 --> 00:17:19,480
You can't just walk away like this!

220
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,400
You brought our family

221
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,559
as a sponsor!

222
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:25,839
How am I supposed to

223
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,240
explain this to my parents?

224
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,839
What happened, Gu Chenyang?

225
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,000
Tell us.

226
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,319
We can help you.

227
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,400
Is it your dad?

228
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,640
Say something!

229
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:45,759
I...

230
00:17:47,519 --> 00:17:48,880
I don't know how to say it.

231
00:17:52,119 --> 00:17:52,640
But

232
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,319
the result is

233
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:56,960
I let you down.

234
00:18:18,559 --> 00:18:19,359
Gu Chenyang,

235
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,319
do you know what this is called?

236
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,400
This is called betrayal!

237
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,720
Leave!

238
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,839
Leave now!

239
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:33,079
We won't talk to you anymore!

240
00:18:37,359 --> 00:18:38,160
Go!

241
00:18:39,599 --> 00:18:40,440
Leave!

242
00:18:40,559 --> 00:18:41,559
Stop it, Lin Qingyuan.

243
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,200
Enough.

244
00:18:52,039 --> 00:18:52,799
I'm sorry.

245
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,160
Go.

246
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,160
Gu Chenyang.

247
00:19:26,559 --> 00:19:27,799
Are you really leaving?

248
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,279
If you leave,

249
00:19:30,599 --> 00:19:31,960
you don't have to come back.

250
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:34,160
Do you want to

251
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,200
break up with me again?

252
00:20:02,559 --> 00:20:03,359
Gu Chenyang.

253
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:04,599
I'm telling you,

254
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:06,160
if you leave, don't come back.

255
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:15,759
Gu Chenyang,

256
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,079
I transferred teams

257
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:02,880
for you.

258
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:04,559
I pulled strings

259
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,599
and risked my reputation.

260
00:22:06,599 --> 00:22:08,119
All for you!

261
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:09,799
You won't know if you can go far

262
00:22:09,799 --> 00:22:11,079
until you try.

263
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:12,079
With what?

264
00:22:13,279 --> 00:22:14,799
Tell me, with what?

265
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:17,279
With your own future?

266
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:21,359
Take Yibei for example.

267
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,640
You're not a top-tier team,

268
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:26,119
but you have a great atmosphere

269
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:27,519
and unity.

270
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:29,240
That's what team spirit is.

271
00:22:43,599 --> 00:22:44,680
Keep it up.

272
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,039
Yibei will win!

273
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:03,160
Those who reach

274
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:04,400
the top of the pyramid

275
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,279
are often lonely.

276
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:09,519
[Achievement and friendship,]

277
00:23:10,599 --> 00:23:12,680
[often you can only choose one.]

278
00:23:13,079 --> 00:23:14,920
[He's so strict with you,]

279
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:17,519
[probably because he cares about you.]

280
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,960
[He hopes your future will be smoother.]

281
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,559
We hope

282
00:23:36,799 --> 00:23:38,319
Yibei Basketball Club

283
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:41,440
can make it to the provincial top eight.

284
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,799
I hope

285
00:23:57,039 --> 00:23:58,160
Yibei Basketball Team

286
00:23:58,519 --> 00:23:59,440
never disbands.

287
00:24:30,039 --> 00:24:30,920
Thank you so much.

288
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,519
Okay, okay.

289
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,000
Bye.

290
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,400
Dad,

291
00:24:36,759 --> 00:24:37,759
you're back just in time.

292
00:24:39,279 --> 00:24:40,680
Coach Cheng just called.

293
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:41,519
The final interview

294
00:24:42,559 --> 00:24:44,480
is next Saturday in Yudong.

295
00:24:47,440 --> 00:24:48,079
Okay,

296
00:24:48,079 --> 00:24:49,039
I'll be there.

297
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,079
